  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0: adds the race catalogue models (CatalogueRace mirroring one GET /race-search/events entry, with CatalogueDistance, AdministrativeArea, CatalogueDetailsEndpoint and the GeoPoint value type) and the course models (Course mirroring a course-service record, the parse result of a GPX import as well as the saved course, with CourseGeoPoint, a deliberately loose CoursePoint, the CoursePrivacy enum over rulePK and the static CourseActivityType map from RaceEventType to activityTypePk); unmodelled fields round-trip through AdditionalProperties. Additive, no breaking change. 2.1.0: adds the race event model for the Garmin Connect calendar (RaceEvent, RaceEventType, EventTarget, DistanceUnit, EventStartTime, RaceEventCustomization, EventPrivacy), mirroring calendar-service JSON so the same object is the create/update body and the read-back. RaceEventType and DistanceUnit are smart enums whose unknown keys round-trip untouched. Additive, no breaking change.",
